  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sihubira Cassava Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Cassava . Beneficiaries: 2,169 smallholder farmers, of whom 1,275 are women. The project will increase cassava production as well as add value to the cassava. The project will provide processing equipment, a truck, storage facilities and working capital to pay farmers cash on delivery and procure planting materials.</narrative>
  </description>
